     "body": "<p>Hmm we have a problem here, since these are all handled via BaseRestResource.handleException():160<br/>\nand ObjectNotInLowLevelStorageExceptions are mapped to a 404. changing this to a 500 will possibly impact other parts of the REST Api.<br/>\nAs it is now, a 404 would be returned if a nonexistant datastream is purged.<br/>\nHow to go on here? Should i introduce logic to differ between datastreams and objects so that for one a 404 can be returned while the other one returns a 500?<br/>\nor leave it like this?</p>",
